**Angled** | Attribute
__Basics__
An attribute used by the angle to mark players who are lynch protected

__Formalized__
On Poll `Lynch` Win:
  • Set Counter to @Voters->Count
  • For Each @OtherVoters:
    ‣ @ThisAttr->Source is @Ind: Decrement Counter
  • Emit `Stop Lynch Angled`
On `Stop Lynch Angled` Emitted: [Condition: @Self->Counter is 0]
  • Announce `Angle @ThisAttr->Source tried to lynch @Self`
  • Protect @Self from `Lynches` through Passive Defense (~UntilUse)
